    <statement><p>Find <m>\&gt;dy/dx\&gt;</m> if  <m>\&gt;y = e^{x}\sqrt{x^{2}+1}</m>.</p>
<p><m>\frac{dy}{dx} =</m> <fillin characters="80" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>e^{x}\sqrt{x^{2}+1}+e^{x}\frac{1}{2\sqrt{x^{2}+1}}\cdot 2x</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
